title: "team_management (stem-bot-v2: table.sql)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_create_team: INSERT member.teams
    q_create_team --> q_gen_uuid: id = gen_random_uuid()
    q_gen_uuid --> q_validate_team: validate name NOT NULL, discord_role_id NOT NULL
    q_validate_team --> q_error_null: name or discord_role_id is NULL
    q_error_null --> [*]: NOT NULL constraint violation
    q_validate_team --> q_insert_team: all fields valid
    q_insert_team --> [*]: team created

    note right of q_create_team
        INV-001: team id is UUID auto-generated via gen_random_uuid()
        INV-002: name is NOT NULL (no unnamed teams)
        INV-003: discord_role_id is NOT NULL (every team has a Discord role)
        INV-004: No UNIQUE constraint on name or discord_role_id (duplicates possible)
    end note
